Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||11-15-2001||02:43 PM||||I was wondering if we can save our password and username so we don't have to type it again. I see that when you visit and you post something that it saves it for following posts but once you leave and come back that you have to type it again. So is there a way around this? Also can we change our password?||||reg||1
Z||000001||isthiswhereiputausername?||11-15-2001||02:49 PM||||at the top you will see profile/perferences, you can do everything there<P>also go to perferences - Store Username & Password in browser memory for 1 year, and this will save your password for you.<P>welcome to the forum!<P>||||reg||1
