Z||000005||Cliff Pennock||11-16-2001||02:34 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B>For some reason mine has stopped storing it even though I have that preference set. Anyone else?<BR>Any problems Cliff?<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If it will not store your username and password, then there's a problem with your cookies. They are either disabled or "full". You might want to try to delete your cookies.||||reg||1
